  "name": "Shrimp Vegetable Stir-Fry",
  "subtitle": "Tender shrimp and crisp vegetables with brown rice",
  "description": "A quick stir-fry combining shrimp, colorful vegetables, and a sweet-tangy soy sauce, served with brown rice.",
